<figure id="A8.T9" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Synthetic query prompt for the MMLU. Applied to all tasks except for history related tasks.</figcaption>
<table id="A8.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
