<figure id="A8.T10" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>Synthetic query prompt for the MMLU history tasks only. The history tasks are <span id="A8.T10.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">high_school_us_history</span>, <span id="A8.T10.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">high_school_world_history</span>, and <span id="A8.T10.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">high_school_european_history</span>. These history tasks required more specific prompting to obtain better results.</figcaption>
